  "visual_findings": [
    "Journal full and compact: browsed Tang row and automatic Qin guidance are visually distinguishable; main page title/body/actions are clear. The lower guidance paragraph is intentionally clipped within its scroll region, with visible scrollbar and downward edge cue; not all guidance text is simultaneously visible.",
    "Fitting equipped/full and guard-preview/compact: actual installation, candidate preview, delta values, save notice and disabled current-equip action remain readable. Preview label explicitly says 尚未装配; no equip/trial action is inferred.",
    "Shen dialogue at both sizes: opt-in choices, portrait, body and footer fit without overlap. Body completes above paper edge.",
    "Inventory normal/full and legal-long-name/compact: all 18 name characters 江湖夜雨青苇渡灯长风归客山河故人行舟 are visible. Name uses two lines and the level suffix leaves 级 on a third line; school and reduced decorative portrait clear the wrapped identity. Equipped captions and item counts stay legible.",
    "Martial learned/full and locked/compact: current, learned and locked statuses, requirements and disabled learning captions remain distinguishable. Bottom rules text is close to the page edge but visibly complete.",
    "Workshop buy/full and sell/compact: zero inventory/coins, prices and shortage reasons are visible; last row and return action stay inside page bounds. Shortage buttons are recorded as enabled by controls metadata, so their status text is not classified as disabled.",
    "Cultivation overview both sizes, compact detail and full deeds: required/current merit, action captions, status band, permanent-learning policy and one-time reward labels are readable; footer remains below folio. These are prepared states, not earned progression.",
    "All 16 frames retain the shared original dark cloth, stitched spine/tassel, brass rules, warm paper and riverside illustration. No missing-texture placeholders, offscreen action/footer, or accidental text overlap was observed in this matrix."
  ],
